WEBVTT

00:04.640 --> 00:06.640
This matter, listen to Xie Xuan

00:07.400 --> 00:09.440
If Shilang's army really wants to retreat

00:09.520 --> 00:11.160
Why go to such lengths

00:11.240 --> 00:12.600
To block information

00:12.680 --> 00:15.013
Not even a carrier pigeon can enter

00:15.120 --> 00:16.600
Now we're cornered

00:17.240 --> 00:18.520
And completely blind

00:18.600 --> 00:19.560
At this time

00:19.640 --> 00:21.640
We're most likely to become gamblers

00:22.040 --> 00:23.400
The more so

00:23.480 --> 00:25.147
The less we should move

00:26.800 --> 00:28.467
Hurry to repair the walls

00:28.800 --> 00:30.000
Yes

00:30.080 --> 00:31.000
Xie Xuan

00:31.080 --> 00:31.760
General Liu

00:31.920 --> 00:33.360
Continue adding internal defenses

00:33.920 --> 00:34.240
Yes

00:34.320 --> 00:35.720
Yes

01:02.480 --> 01:04.480
No movement in the city yet

01:05.280 --> 01:06.160
Reporting, General

01:06.240 --> 01:07.200
Not yet

01:07.280 --> 01:08.160
That coward Prince of Jin

01:08.240 --> 01:09.520
Is as timid as a mouse

01:09.600 --> 01:10.440
Scared by the general

01:10.520 --> 01:11.920
Won't move a step

01:12.920 --> 01:14.320
General

01:14.520 --> 01:15.720
Chanyu Ayidai these past days

01:15.800 --> 01:17.320
Has been sending messages asking

01:17.400 --> 01:19.080
If we don't take Yiyang soon

01:19.160 --> 01:20.520
Hurry, hurry, hurry

01:20.600 --> 01:21.960
Hurry your mother

01:24.600 --> 01:26.267
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao

01:27.040 --> 01:28.600
I'll remember this

01:30.520 --> 01:31.920
Return to camp

01:32.040 --> 01:33.080
Tell the other side

01:33.160 --> 01:34.560
To prepare for me

01:37.600 --> 01:39.000
Report

01:40.520 --> 01:42.520
No activity found in the south

01:44.720 --> 01:45.880
Report

01:45.960 --> 01:47.960
No activity found in the west

01:51.400 --> 01:53.067
Could they really have withdrawn?

02:04.720 --> 02:05.280
What's going on?

02:05.360 --> 02:06.080
Report

02:06.160 --> 02:06.720
Urgent report

02:06.800 --> 02:07.840
Urgent report from the west

02:07.920 --> 02:10.520
The Wuzhao have broken in from the west

02:10.600 --> 02:11.720
Into the city

02:11.800 --> 02:13.200
How could they enter the city?

02:13.280 --> 02:14.440
Don't panic yet

02:14.520 --> 02:15.560
What's the situation in the west now?

02:15.640 --> 02:16.640
I've been hearing

02:16.720 --> 02:17.760
Sounds these past days

02:17.840 --> 02:18.400
I've been

02:18.480 --> 02:19.880
Resting poorly lately

02:19.960 --> 02:20.640
Always hearing

02:20.720 --> 02:22.120
Tapping sounds

02:22.600 --> 02:23.160
Always dreaming

02:23.240 --> 02:24.960
Of Wuzhao horses trampling me

02:25.400 --> 02:27.067
I thought it was hallucinations

02:27.280 --> 02:28.200
Now I know

02:28.280 --> 02:29.920
The Wuzhao dug tunnels

02:30.000 --> 02:31.400
Undermining the wall foundations

02:31.560 --> 02:32.480
The Wuzhao elite

02:32.560 --> 02:33.720
Have already emerged from the tunnels

02:33.800 --> 02:34.720
Taking the gates

02:34.800 --> 02:37.133
General Liu is holding with his men

02:39.600 --> 02:40.840
Report

02:40.920 --> 02:42.600
The Wuzhao army from the north has turned back

02:42.680 --> 02:44.347
Preparing to attack the city

02:44.560 --> 02:45.160
The north

02:45.240 --> 02:46.520
Many volunteers at the west gate

02:46.600 --> 02:47.640
If they defect

02:47.720 --> 02:48.400
I'm afraid we can't hold

02:48.480 --> 02:49.720
Yes, we can't hold

02:49.800 --> 02:51.040
This is fighting on two fronts

02:51.160 --> 02:52.080
But we have so few men

02:52.160 --> 02:52.960
Right

02:53.040 --> 02:53.760
How can we defend?

02:53.840 --> 02:55.240
We simply can't hold

02:56.040 --> 02:57.440
Don't panic

02:58.240 --> 02:59.040
Everyone

02:59.120 --> 03:00.040
Reinforce the north

03:00.120 --> 03:01.520
The northern front

03:01.600 --> 03:03.080
Will be commanded by General Zhu

03:03.160 --> 03:04.400
Bring all available equipment

03:04.480 --> 03:06.400
Must stop the Wuzhao main force

03:06.480 --> 03:07.880
I accept the order

03:08.120 --> 03:08.680
You all

03:08.800 --> 03:09.400
Follow me

03:09.480 --> 03:10.880
Yes

03:15.720 --> 03:16.960
Xie Xuan

03:17.040 --> 03:18.400
Your general is here
